# HoneyBeeSMP — Minecraft mods
#
# One mod per line:
#
#     <the-exact-jar-filename>.jar  <direct-download-url>
#
# The filename must match the file on the server exactly. The deploy
# downloads any mod listed here that is missing from the target server,
# and removes any mod that is no longer listed, so the dev and live
# servers always run the same mod set.
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Before you add a mod
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# 1. It must be a SERVER-side mod. Check the mod's page on Modrinth: if
#    it says "Client: Required", it will crash the server on startup with
#    "NoClassDefFoundError: org/lwjgl/Version" or similar. Mods like
#    Sodium, Xaero's and JourneyMap are client-only and do not belong here.
#
# 2. It must match our setup:
#        Minecraft 1.21.1, NeoForge, loader 21.1.264
#
# 3. If it needs another mod (a library or API), list that too - the
#    manifest has no notion of dependencies.
#
# 4. Get the direct download URL and the exact filename from the
#    Modrinth API. The entry with "primary": true is the one you want.
#
# Then add your line below, push to develop, and let the dev server
# install it. Restart the server afterwards so it loads the mod.
#
# The full walkthrough is in README.md, under "Adding a mod".
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Example:
#
#   Terralith_1.21.1_v2.6.2_Neoforge.jar  https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8oi3bsk5/versions/IY93YaEe/Terralith_1.21.1_v2.6.2_Neoforge.jar
#
# Currently no mods are installed.

# A test pair: terralith needs lithostitched, so both are listed.
lithostitched-1.8.1-neoforge-21.1.jar  https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XaDC71GB/versions/cZu4cHY3/lithostitched-1.8.1-neoforge-21.1.jar
Terralith_1.21.1_v2.6.2_Neoforge.jar  https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8oi3bsk5/versions/IY93YaEe/Terralith_1.21.1_v2.6.2_Neoforge.jar
